# Directory → Redmine project map

> **Template.** Copy to `projects.md` next to this file and fill in your own rows:
> `cp projects.md.example projects.md`. `projects.md` is gitignored — the real map names
> clients and private projects, and this repository is public. `start.sh` seeds it from this
> template when it is missing.

| Subproject / area | Redmine identifier |
|---|---|
| `clawbot` — you, your workspace and your skills | `clawbot` |
| `<directory or site>` | `<redmine-project-identifier>` |
